{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Peter's Job Interview", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Getting Ready for the Interview", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Exchange information on instructions about basic activities and safety at work.  ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Times and Dates", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the question<span class=\"italic\"> What time is it?</span> to ask for the time now.  You can use <span class=\"italic\">When is the ... ?</span> to ask for the day and date of an activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the prepositions <span class=\"strong\">on</span>,<span class=\"strong\"> in</span>, and <span class=\"strong\">at</span> when you talk about the time and the date.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use <span class=\"strong\">on</span> to talk about the date:<span class=\"italic\"> on the 1st, on the 2nd, on the 3rd</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use <span class=\"strong\"> in</span> to talk about the period: <span class=\"italic\">in 15 minutes, in an hour </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use <span class=\"strong\">at</span> to talk about a specific time: <span class=\"italic\">at 9:00 a.m., at  2:30 p.m.  </span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Asking for, Accepting and Declining Help", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you need help, here's how you can ask in a polite way. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When someone wants to help you, here's how you can accept or say no (decline).  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Ask for Help</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Accept Offers of Help</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Decline Offers of Help</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Thank you. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Thank you, but I'm ok. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you help me ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's very helpful of you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I don't need any help, thanks.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could I ask you to ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thanks for the offer!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I appreciate the offer, but ... </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: Can you help me practice? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Barbara</span>: Sure! Let me give you some advice. <br /><span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: That's very helpful of you!<br /> <span class=\"strong\">Barbara</span>: Do you want me to write notes?<br /><span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: I appreciate the offer, but it's okay.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to practice ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do something again and again to become better at it ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm practicing for my interview.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when preparing for an interview.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "volunteer ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who does a job without getting any money ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm a volunteer at the library.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pointer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a useful piece of information that helps you  do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"},